          "hideComponent": "false",
          "topMargin": "1",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Dec 18 2025 21:26:33 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Empowering the people who power each moment.</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">That’s smart.</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Built around the realities of modern care delivery, the <a title=\"Learn more about the SmartHospital Platform\" href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/smart-hospital.html\">SmartHospital Platform</a> connects infrastructure, communication, workflows, and intelligence to support coordinated, patient-centered care. By helping streamline clinical and operational workflows, it gives clinicians more time to focus on what matters most: caring for patients.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 06 2026 17:47:04 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
