          "jcr:created": "Thu Dec 18 2025 21:26:33 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\">Workflow engine</span></h3>\n<h3>Coordinating every process, across every system.</h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Vocera Engage is the workflow engine that powers the SmartHospital Platform. Engage enables filtering, routing, escalation and prioritization of alarms and notifications* Keep your staff informed with relevant information when patient care moves fast.</span></p>\n",
