          "jcr:created": "Thu Dec 18 2025 21:26:33 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\">Ambient intelligence</span></h3>\n<h3>Making the hospital aware.</h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Transform ordinary care environments into intelligent, always-aware spaces. Ambient sensors deliver critical insights to the virtual command center, supporting patient and operational awareness across care settings. This data helps inform near real time decision support and supports workforce and workflow optimization, compliance and process management.</span></p>\n",
